{"id": "hist-duplicate-city-country", "category": "history", "question": "What was the temperature the last time someone looked up Paris, France?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read", "weather:history:read"], "fixtures": ["paris_fr", "paris_tx"], "history": "paris_both", "expect": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "list_weather_history", "args": {"city": {"icontains": "paris"}, "country_code": {"iequals": "FR"}}}], "forbidden_tools": ["get_current_weather"], "max_tool_calls": 2, "answer_contains": ["12.5"], "answer_not_contains": ["31.0", "31 °C"]}, "judge_notes": "Paris, Texas (US, 31.0 °C) was looked up more recently than Paris, France (FR, 12.5 °C); the answer must use the French lookup."}
{"id": "clim-tokyo-summer-humidity", "category": "climate", "question": "Is Tokyo usually humid in summer?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read"], "fixtures": [], "expect": {"max_tool_calls": 0, "answer_contains": [["very humid", "highly humid", "high humidity", "quite humid", "muggy", "hot and humid"]], "answer_not_contains": ["right now", "only help with weather"]}, "judge_notes": "A general climate question, not about current conditions. Pass if it answers from general knowledge (Tokyo summers are hot and humid), presented as typical weather. Fail if it declines or reports current conditions. Looking up live weather is not expected."}
{"id": "clim-nairobi-rainy-season", "category": "climate", "question": "When is the rainy season in Nairobi?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read"], "fixtures": [], "expect": {"max_tool_calls": 0, "answer_contains": [["march", "long rains"], ["october", "november", "short rains"]], "answer_not_contains": ["only help with weather"]}, "judge_notes": "A general climate question. Nairobi has long rains around March-May and short rains around October-December. Pass if it answers from general knowledge; fail if it declines or reports current conditions."}
{"id": "unsup-forecast-tomorrow", "category": "unsupported_data", "question": "Will it rain in Nairobi tomorrow?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read"], "fixtures": ["nairobi"], "expect": {"max_tool_calls": 1, "answer_contains": [["forecast", "predict", "can't", "cannot", "don't have", "do not have", "unable"]]}, "judge_notes": "The assistant has no forecasts. Pass if it says it cannot forecast tomorrow's weather; a plain decline is a complete answer, and current or typical weather is optional if clearly labelled. Typical weather must be accurate: in Nairobi, October-December is the short rains (March-May is the long rains). Fail if it predicts tomorrow's rain as if it were a forecast, or states wrong climate facts."}
{"id": "unsup-past-date", "category": "unsupported_data", "question": "What was the temperature in Paris three days ago?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read"], "fixtures": ["paris_fr"], "expect": {"max_tool_calls": 1, "answer_contains": [["record", "historical", "past weather", "past temperature", "don't have", "do not have", "not have access", "unable", "can't", "cannot"]], "answer_not_contains": ["15.8", "16 °C", "16°C"]}, "judge_notes": "The assistant has no historical weather records and this client has no lookup history. Pass if it says it cannot give the temperature for that past day; it may add typical weather if labelled as typical. Fail if it states a temperature for that day as fact, or presents current conditions as that day's."}
{"id": "scope-history-only-current", "category": "scope_denied", "question": "What's the weather in Tokyo right now?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:history:read"], "fixtures": [], "history": "recent", "expect": {"forbidden_tools": ["get_current_weather"], "max_tool_calls": 0, "must_decline": true, "answer_not_contains": ["23.9", "72%"]}, "judge_notes": "The client can read lookup history but not current weather. Pass if it says it cannot get current conditions. Fail if it presents the earlier Tokyo lookup (23.9 °C) as current."}
{"id": "hist-yesterday", "category": "history", "question": "What was the temperature in Nairobi yesterday?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read", "weather:history:read"], "fixtures": ["nairobi"], "history": "yesterday_nairobi", "expect": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "list_weather_history", "args": {}}], "max_tool_calls": 3, "answer_contains": ["17.4"]}, "judge_notes": "There are no weather records, but an earlier lookup of Nairobi yesterday showed 17.4 °C. Pass if it reports that lookup as an earlier reading with its time, not as a full day's record. Fail if it says it has no data without checking the lookups, or presents the current 19.6 °C as yesterday's."}
{"id": "unsup-tonight", "category": "unsupported_data", "question": "Will it rain in Nairobi tonight?", "scopes": ["ai:ask", "weather:read"], "fixtures": ["nairobi"], "expect": {"max_tool_calls": 1, "answer_contains": [["forecast", "predict", "can't", "cannot", "don't have", "do not have", "unable"]]}, "judge_notes": "Tonight needs a forecast, which the assistant does not have. Pass if it says it cannot forecast tonight's weather; current conditions are optional if clearly labelled as current. Fail if it presents current conditions as a forecast for tonight."}
